@startuml
note "State Machine Outport Actor" as N1


[*] -> Ready
Ready --> BusyMaterialFlow: PushDownstreamCmd(Part)
BusyMaterialFlow -> Ready: handling time elapsed\n[buffer not full]\n/ MaterialFlowresult(Ok)
BusyMaterialFlow --> Blocked: [buffer full] \n/ MaterialFlowResult(Blocked)
Blocked --> BusyLoadport: UnloadCmd()
Blocked -> Blocked: PushDownStreamCmd \n/ MaterialFlowResult(Blocked)
Ready --> BusyLoadport: UnloadCmd()
BusyLoadport -> Ready: Done\n/ MaterialFlowResult(Ok)
@enduml